	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["51D5B5C004491077"]
			description: [
				"the Circle of Fabrication runs the alembic's own trick backwards: instead of breaking an item into essentia, it fuses essentia straight into an item. eight &5nigredo&r essentia plus four each of &cfire&r/&9water&r/&2earth&r/&7air&r fuse into &5chaos essence&r -- the undifferentiated pre-elemental state, before the four classical elements split apart."
				""
				"chaos essence also weaves into &cpyrium&r (fire+air) and bottled XP (water+earth) at the manaweaving altar."
			]
			id: "270F7BBFAA80139A"
			subtitle: "four elements, forced to agree"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1AE3507AD0CF9579"
				item: "kubejs:chaos_essence"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Chaos Essence"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["270F7BBFAA80139A"]
			description: [
				"&aprima materia&r is the combined form of all four elements. bind &5chaos essence&r, a &6holy silver ingot&r, and a pinch of &dmagichem admixture&r at the alchemy table for &6prima materia seed&r."
				""
				"a bound &6afrit&r rituals the seed with an &delement attunement stone&r and another admixture pinch, plus afrit essence, into &aprima materia&r."
				""
				"&9note:&r its plates also brew &5epic ink&r later, so don't stop at one."
			]
			id: "3C613081F4FE51B2"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "the first matter"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0A2DE3E8C71654D5"
				item: "gtceu:prima_materia_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Prima Materia"
			x: -0.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3C613081F4FE51B2"]
			description: [
				"the &6alchemical nexus&r runs a second Ritual of the Balanced Scales, three stages deeper this time. resonant gravitite core, an element attunement stone, and a gravitic sigil open it; the final stage folds in two &aprima materia&r and journeyman's own &6wisdom stone: nigredo&r into &6wisdom stone: albedo&r."
				""
				"wear it and initiate's elementite shortcut opens: raw materia straight to ambrosia-touched elementite, no ambrosium chain needed."
			]
			id: "74085062F99B8D8C"
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "the whitening"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3D4289E3C7C1D793"
				item: "magichem:wisdom_stone_albedo"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Wisdom Stone: Albedo"
			x: 1.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3C613081F4FE51B2"]
			description: [
				"&5demon will&r manifests near mobs once your soul network is well-stocked -- snare it with a &6soul snare&r or a sentient tool. five flavors exist (raw, corrosive, destructive, steadfast, vengeful), same display name, different item ids -- check the tooltip."
				""
				"you've been spending prima materia's plates upward; this tier's own gravitic components start eating will too. stock up on whichever flavor your current recipe wants."
			]
			id: "67B9B6F1E671C377"
			subtitle: "the mobs' problem becomes yours"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5A25286EFEC4035A"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "ftbfiltersystem:smart_filter"
